    "Details": "The C configuration of the Hobgoblin II OmniProtoMech pairs an electronics package, consisting of a Watchdog CEWS and a Light TAG, with arm-mounted Chemical Medium Lasers. Its Magnetic Clamp System lets it ride into battle on friendly 'Mechs, and like every Hobgoblin II it is mostly deployed around critical Coreun facilities alongside fast medium or assault OmniMechs such as the Gatekeeper.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.978</color></b>",
